route: provider-a at provider-no-training / top (with scrub, restore, topic pinning, personas, chaff, exposure ledger)
1. rated sensitive by the classifier
2. the health category is locked, so the classifier's sensitive stands
3. sensitive requests may go as far as provider-no-training, once scrubbed
4. hard work needs at least a top model
5. cheapest allowed: provider-a at provider-no-training / top (cost 20)
6. leaves the local layer rated sensitive, so: scrub, restore, topic pinning, personas, chaff, exposure ledger
